.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Cygwin/Windows crash dumps
*.stackdump

# VPS demo/test setup: prometheus token is generated at runtime from
# /var/lib/ebpf-guard/token (synced by the deploy step) — never committed.
deploy/docker-test-setup/prometheus-token.txt


# Attack-run raw output (server-logs/, attack-results/): sizeable binary/
# plaintext-alert dumps pulled from the VPS stand for analysis (see
# plan.md, вопрос 13). Only the small runs/<date>-summary.json from
# run-gate.sh is meant to be committed.
server-logs/
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/attack-results/
# Per-run attacker PID/comm manifest. It sits next to the scripts (all
# producers and consumers anchor to SCRIPT_DIR) rather than under
# attack-results/, so it needs its own entry — it is regenerated each run and
# would otherwise show up as a dirty tracked directory after every progon.
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/attack-manifest.json
# Критерий 6 (5.9.6f, находка №75): сигнатура расхождения «прогон vs база»
# прошлого запуска гейта, нужна только чтобы поймать, когда одно и то же
# расхождение держится два замера подряд (значит, база брошена). Та же
# причина, что у attack-manifest.json выше — регенерируется каждым прогоном.
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/detection-baseline-diff-state.txt
# Per-category output from the four attack sub-scripts (RESULTS_DIR in each).
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/sqlmap-results/
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/ssrf-results/
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/bruteforce-results/
deploy/docker-test-setup/attacks/ldap-csrf-results/
